                        <li>Logical Frameworks & Theory of Change</li>
                        <li>Implementation strategies & monitoring frameworks</li>
                        <li>Outcome documentation & project reviews</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="service-num">Service Area 4.2</span>
                    <h3>Research, Assessment & Evaluation</h3>
                    <p>From Evidence to Action: Research → Analysis → Findings → Recommendations → Action.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Baseline, Mid-term & End-line studies</li>
                        <li>Scoping, Needs & Social assessments</li>
                        <li>Participatory research & community consultations</li>
                        <li>Programme evaluations & Impact assessments</li>
                        <li>Qualitative research reports & Policy briefs</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="service-num">Service Area 4.3 • Signature Expertise</span>
                    <h3>Gender, Equity & Social Inclusion (GESI)</h3>
                    <p>Mainstreaming equity and empowerment across institutions and communities.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Gender mainstreaming & gender-responsive planning</li>
                        <li>Gender analysis & gender budgeting support</li>
                        <li>Women's empowerment & gender sensitisation</li>
                        <li>Vulnerability assessments & social inclusion strategies</li>
                        <li>Community-level gender interventions & documentation</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="service-num">Service Area 4.4</span>
                    <h3>Livelihood & Local Economic Development</h3>
                    <p>Building sustainable rural and urban livelihood ecosystems.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Livelihood planning & SHG-based livelihoods</li>
                        <li>Micro-enterprise & Community Enterprise development</li>
                        <li>Entrepreneurship promotion & skill development</li>
                        <li>Market linkage, value-chain & business planning</li>
                        <li>Urban livelihoods & Local Economic Development (LED)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
