                    <ul>
                        <li>Decentralised, participatory & local development planning</li>
                        <li>Community mobilisation & CBO/SHG strengthening</li>
                        <li>Institution building & community-based monitoring</li>
                        <li>Urban development & poverty reduction strategies</li>
                        <li>Community-led localisation of SDGs</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="service-num">Service Area 4.6</span>
                    <h3>Training & Capacity Building</h3>
                    <p>One-day workshops, multi-day trainings, residential programmes, ToT & online sessions.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Training Needs Assessment (TNA) & module development</li>
                        <li>Training facilitation & Training of Trainers (ToT)</li>
                        <li>Community leadership & team building</li>
