                        <li>Annual, monthly, quarterly & administration reports</li>
                        <li>Impact reports & best-practice documentation</li>
                        <li>Case studies, success stories & development articles</li>
                        <li>Concept notes & campaign communication</li>
                        <li>IEC planning and bilingual content development</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
                <div>
                    <span class="service-num">Service Area 4.8</span>
                    <h3>Campaign Design & Social Media</h3>
                    <p>End-to-end communication campaigns for behaviour change and public awareness.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Campaign concept, audience & multi-platform strategy</li>
                        <li>Themes: Gender equality, Waste management, Public health</li>
                        <li>Themes: Livelihoods, Climate action, Social protection</li>
                        <li>Creative content plans, outreach & monitoring</li>
